  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Radialistas y Radioteca Consolidaci&#xF3;n Estrat&#xE9;gica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mission of Radialistas is to contribute to the democratization of communications, especially radio broadcasting, from the perspective of gender and citizenship.  The current project will consolidate the work of Radialistas and Radioteca in order to provide a more comprehensive package of communications and capacity building resources for broadcasters, journalists and civil society leaders in Latin America.  Joining the two areas of work will lead to more interactivity on the part of users generating a greater sharing of productions, audios and ideas in order to create an increased dynamic for positive change in the Region.</narrative>
  </description>
